<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta
        name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Dom Blood Portfolio of Works V2</title>

    <link
        href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
        rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="bootstrap.css">

    <script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.7.1/jquery.min.js"></script>

</head>

<body class="bg-light">

    <main class="container py-4      <p>
            This is a small demonstration of my portfolio of works. Whilst I am
            not a web developer, I have a keen interest in increasing my
            knowledge of web technologies and the development of web
            applications.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">
            About Me
        </h2>

        <p>
            My name is Dom Blood. I graduated from Sheffield Hallam University
            in 2024 with a First Class Honours degree in IT Consultancy.
        </p>

        <p>
            Aptly titled
            <strong>
                "Bringing Enterprise Architecture (EA) Value to Local
                Government: A Case Study"
            </strong>,
            I explored the benefits of Enterprise Architecture and how its
            practices could be utilised to avoid unnecessary costs within major
            project implementations.
        </p>

        <p>
            I have worked in Local Government for 8 years, progressing from a
            Level 2 Apprentice through to my Master's degree where I now work
            as an AI Architect. Recently, I obtained the Microsoft Certified AI
            Transformation Leader certification.
        </p>

        <figure class="text-center mb-5">

            <img
                id="certificationImage"
                src="cert.png"
                alt="Microsoft Certified AI Transformation Leader Certificationtion>

        </figure>

        <h2 class="mt-5">
            My Current Knowledge of Web Technologies
        </h2>

        <p>
            My current knowledge of web technologies is limited to HTML, CSS
            and JavaScript. I continue to develop my understanding through both
            my professional role and postgraduate study.
        </p>

        <p>
            Information on the journal can be found in the
            <a
                href="https://www.digisaslab.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/CfP-2024-latest-20240129.pdf"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">

                DigiSasLab Call for Papers Document

            </a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">
            Latest Technology News
        </h2>

        <p>
            The latest article below is retrieved dynamically using a public
            REST API when the page loads.
        </p>

        <section id="newsSection">

            <div
                id="newsContainer"
                class="card shadow-sm">

                <div class="card-body">

                    <p>
                        Loading latest technology news...
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>

        <h2 class="mt-5">
            More Information
        </h2>

        <p>
            For more information about me, please visit my

            <a
                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dominic-blood-288a4b236/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">

                LinkedIn Profile

            </a>.

        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-5">
            Ask a Question
        </h2>

        <p>
            If you would like to know more about my professional background,
            research experience, or certifications, please complete the form
            below.
        </p>

        <form
            id="questionForm"
            class="card shadow-sm p-4">

            <fieldset class="border rounded p-3 mb-4">

                <legend class="float-none w-auto px-2">
                    Your Details
                </legend>

                <div class="mb-3">

                    <label
                        for="firstname"
                        class="form-label">

                        First Name

                    </label>

                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="firstname"
                        name="firstname"
                        class="form-control"
                        required>

                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">

                    <label
                        for="surname"
                        class="form-label">

                        Surname

                    </label>

                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="surname"
                        name="surname"
                        class="form-control"
                        required>

                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">

                    <label
                        for="email"
                        class="form-label">

                        Email Address

                    </label>

                    <input
                        type="email"
                        id="email"
                        name="email"
                        class="form-control"
                        required>

                </div>

            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="border rounded p-3 mb-4">

                <legend class="float-none w-auto px-2">
                    Question Type
                </legend>

                <p>
                    Please select the category that best describes your question.
                </p>

                <div class="form-check">

                    <input
                        class="form-check-input"
                        type="radio"
                        id="background"
                        name="questiontype"
                        value="Professional Background"
                        required>

                    <label
                        class="form-check-label"
                        for="background">

                        Professional Background

                    </label>

                </div>

                <div class="form-check">

                    <input
                        class="form-check-input"
                        type="radio"
                        id="research"
                        name="questiontype"
                        value="Research Experience">

                    <label
                        class="form-check-label"
                        for="research">

                        Research Experience

                    </label>

                </div>

                <div class="form-check">

                    <input
                        class="form-check-input"
                        type="radio"
                        id="certification"
                        name="questiontype"
                        value="Certification Advice">

                    <label
                        class="form-check-label"
                        for="certification">

                        Certification Advice

                    </label>

                </div>

            </fieldset>

            <div class="mb-3">

                <label
                    for="question"
                    class="form-label">

                    Your Question

                </label>

                <textarea
                    id="question"
                    name="question"
                    rows="6"
                    class="form-control"
                    placeholder="Please enter your question here..."
                    required></textarea>

            </div>

            <div class="mt-3">

                <button
                    type="submit"
                    class="btn btn-primary">

                    Submit Question

                </button>

                <button
                    type="reset"
                    class="btn btn-secondary">

                    Clear Form

                </button>

            </div>

        </form>

        <section
            id="confirmationSection"
            class="alert alert-success mt-4">

            <h2>
                Submission Confirmation
            </h2>

            <div id="confirmation">

                <p>
                    No questions have been submitted yet.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

    <script>

        $(document).ready(function () {

            $("#confirmationSection").hide();

            $("#certificationImage").hover(

                function () {
                    $(this).fadeTo(300, 0.7);
                },

                function () {
                    $(this).fadeTo(300, 1);
                }
            );

        });

        document
            .getElementById("questionForm")
            .addEventListener("submit", function (event) {

                event.preventDefault();

                const firstName =
                    document.getElementById("firstname").value;

                const surname =
                    document.getElementById("surname").value;

                const question =
                    document.getElementById("question").value;

                const questionType =
                    document.querySelector(
                        'input[name="questiontype"]:checked'
                    ).value;

                document.getElementById("confirmation").innerHTML =

                    "<p><strong>Thank you " +
                    firstName +
                    " " +
                    surname +
                    ".</strong></p>" +

                    "<p>Your question has been successfully received.</p>" +

                    "<p><strong>Question Type:</strong> " +
                    questionType +
                    "</p>" +

                    "<p><strong>Your Question:</strong> " +
                    question +
                    "</p>";

                $("#confirmationSection").slideDown(1000);

            });

        fetch("https://api.spaceflightnewsapi.net/v4/articles/?limit=1")

            .then(function (response) {

                if (!response.ok) {

                    throw new Error(
                        "Unable to retrieve article."
                    );

                }

                return response.json();

            })

            .then(function (data) {

                const article = data.results[0];

                document.getElementById("newsContainer").innerHTML =

                    "<div class='card-body'>" +

                    "<h3>" +
                    article.title +
                    "</h3>" +

                    "<p>" +
                    article.summary +
                    "</p>" +

                    "<p><strong>Source:</strong> " +
                    article.news_site +
                    "</p>" +

                    "<p><strong>Published:</strong> " +
                    new Date(
                        article.published_at
                    ).toLocaleDateString('en-GB') +
                    "</p>" +

                    "<a class='btn btn-primary' href='" +
                    article.url +
                    "' target='_blank'>" +
                    "Read Full Article" +
                    "</a>" +

                    "</div>";

            })

            .catch(function () {

                document.getElementById("newsContainer").innerHTML =

                    "<div class='card-body'>" +

                    "<p>The latest technology article could not be loaded.</p>" +

                    "</div>";

            });

    </script>

    https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js    </script>

</body>

</html>
